name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CHIKAMI MILTEC INC</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CHIKAMI MILTEC INC.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CHIKAMI, KUNIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CHIKAMI KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CHIKAMI, KUNIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A retainer wire, wherein an extraction strength is improved at a connected portion between a plastic portion and a metallic wire and also a resistance to metallic allergy is improved, comprising a holding part formed in an arc-shape so that it can be brought into contact with a tooth row and a metallic wire installed extendedly from both ends of the holding part, characterized by that the holding part is made of a synthetic resin having a transparency and a specified mechanical strength and the metallic wire is formed integrally with the holding part.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un fil de retenue dans lequel la force d'extraction est augmentée au niveau d'une partie reliée entre une partie en plastique et un fil métallique, et dans lequel la résistance à l'allergie aux métaux est accrue. Ledit fil comprend une partie de maintien arquée de sorte qu'elle puisse être mise en contact avec une rangée de dents, et un fil métallique s'étendant d'une extrémité à l'autre de la partie de maintien, la partie de maintien étant fabriquée dans une résine synthétique présentant une certaine transparence et résistance mécanique et le fil métallique faisant partie intégrante de la partie de maintien.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>